{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Liquid Peak: Offroad\u00a0</i></strong>is a calm, focused game about offroad driving and terrain linking. it challenges you to create and conquer a growing chain of rugged landscapes. You begin with a floating hill. Place the next piece. Shape the terrain. Drive the trail. Try to drive across the path you\u2019ve built and climbs skyward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pure Offroad Experience</strong><br>Drive across tight paths, brutal obstacles, and master hill climbs. Every turn tests your control, balance, and terrain-reading instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrain Linking</strong> <br>Lay down modular mountain tiles to extend your trail. Each new tile offers surprising paths but must connect logically\u2014think strategy before you drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Terrain Deformation</strong><br>Shape terrain, build bridge and adjust slopes in real time to ensure your trail flows\u2014and is actually driveable, even when heading uphill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Minimalism</strong><br>A pure, stylized world with soft lighting and natural ambiance that keeps your focus on terrain and trail.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801990?t=1749940580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/9236ffd665a0772bb51a759f0d94159534365319/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749940580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/f66abbc8377a83af74efef21f622d029673a5d04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749940580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/f66abbc8377a83af74efef21f622d029673a5d04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749940580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Liquid Peak: Offroad\u00a0</i></strong>is a calm, focused game about offroad driving and terrain linking. it challenges you to create and conquer a growing chain of rugged landscapes. You begin with a floating hill. Place the next piece. Shape the terrain. Drive the trail. Try to drive across the path you\u2019ve built and climbs skyward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pure Offroad Experience</strong><br>Drive across tight paths, brutal obstacles, and master hill climbs. Every turn tests your control, balance, and terrain-reading instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrain Linking</strong> <br>Lay down modular mountain tiles to extend your trail. Each new tile offers surprising paths but must connect logically\u2014think strategy before you drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Terrain Deformation</strong><br>Shape terrain, build bridge and adjust slopes in real time to ensure your trail flows\u2014and is actually driveable, even when heading uphill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Minimalism</strong><br>A pure, stylized world with soft lighting and natural ambiance that keeps your focus on terrain and trail.</p>","developers":["Ludic Atlas"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801990/bef095232d6621ecfe7cb8e89aa2cc016713368d/header.jpg?t=1749940580","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156645,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156645/movie480.mp